6\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With every torch lit and every table set, you shape the story of a bygone age. Create noble halls of grandeur, humble cottages of warmth, or eerie chambers of mystery. <br>The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crumbling wells, swings beneath old trees, stone statues, birdcages, signboards, barrels, and firelit torches. Every corner alive with medieval atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Skulls, pots, buckets, candelabras, cradles, laundry boards, crates, bats, and countless small touches that whisper forgotten tales of daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969000/extras/a30fa4c3441515dadc4d8882f96680e3.poster.avif?t=1758535516\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969000/extras/a30fa4c3441515dadc4d8882f96680e3.webm?t=1758535516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969000/extras/a30fa4c3441515dadc4d8882f96680e3.mp4?t=1758535516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969000/extras/104842d46de50a92bf49bcd91cdea74c.avif?t=1758535516\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Middle Ages are alive once more. Take up the mission, step through the gates, and leave your mark on history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969000/extras/3cc1ec6117687b9e23249